Package: StructuralModelTester
Title: Visual Structural Model Tester
Version: 0.2.10
Authors@R: person("Baptiste Jacquet", email = "contact@bjacquet.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny workbench for path / SEM models: draw confirmatory,
    exploratory, fixed, measurement, and interaction links on a canvas; fit with
    classical p-values, AIC/BIC search (optional Σw rejection and model
    averaging), or Bayesian brms (HDI, pd, ROPE, log BF10, MCMC/PPC
    diagnostics); simulate from unstandardized expected slopes used as priors;
    inspect conditional / marginal and mediation effects with pedagogical field
    help; and run confirmatory Monte Carlo power analysis.
